# Basking Capybara {1}{G} (1/3): "Descend 4 - This creature gets +3/+0 as long as there are four or more permanent cards in your
# graveyard" (CR 207.2c, 110.4a, 613.4c). Emerald and Jet pay it on turn 1. On turn 3: Thought Scour on Bot1 mills two Plains (two
# permanent cards: still 1/3), Black Lotus is sacrificed for mana (three permanent cards, four cards in all with the Scour: still
# 1/3, so the instant counts for nothing), a second Thought Scour on Bot2 puts two Ornithopters (plus the one Bot2 discarded to hand
# size on turn 2) into Bot2's graveyard (six permanent cards in all, but only Bot1's count: still 1/3), and Mind Stone, sacrificed
# for its "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card", makes four: exactly the limit, 4/3 (the toughness stays 3).

